.Dd June 18, 2026
.Dt ZCLAUDE 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zclaude
.Nd Claude Code launcher tuned for zdots platform work
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op task ...
.Nm
.Fl -sync
.Nm
.Fl -auto Ar task
.Nm
.Fl -feature
.Op task ...
.Op Fl -model Ar name
.Op Fl n | Fl -dry-run
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
wraps
.Xr claude 1
with the harmonized configuration for maintaining and extending the zdots
platform: it launches from the kernel cwd
.Pq Pa ~/.config/zsh
so
.Pa bin/
and the tracked
.Pa .claude/settings.json
permissions and hooks apply, appends a pre-loaded platform bootstrap prompt,
adds the platform-trio peer repos
.Pq Pa ~/my , Pa ~/.config/nvim
with
.Fl -add-dir ,
and applies a conservative split-model policy.
.Pp
adots is reached through its bare-git invocations and needs no
.Fl -add-dir ;
.Pa $HOME
is deliberately not added, keeping the PHI/secret surface minimal.
.Sh MODES
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Nm Op task ...
Interactive maintenance session (sonnet). A task, if given, seeds the prompt.
.It Nm Fl -sync
Headless four-repo platform-sync review (haiku), report-only, then exit.
.It Nm Fl -auto Ar task
Headless automation via
.Fl -print
(haiku). Requires a task.
.It Nm Fl -feature Op task ...
Feature implementation (opus) with
.Fl -permission-mode Cm plan
for plan-first changes.
.El
.Sh CONTINUITY
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl c , Fl -continue
Resume the most recent zclaude conversation in the kernel cwd.
.It Fl r , Fl -resume
Pick a past session to resume (interactive picker).
.It Fl -name Ar name
Set a findable display name for the session.
.El
.Pp
Durable cross-session context is carried by the zdots memory file and the
Knowledge Layer, independent of conversation resume.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -model Ar name
Override the model for this run (alias or full id).
.It Fl -effort Ar level
Override the per-mode effort: low, medium, high, xhigh, max.
.It Fl -tmux
Launch inside a tmux session (persistent; detach and reattach).
.It Fl n , Fl -dry-run
Print the resolved
.Xr claude 1
invocation without running it.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.It Fl -
Pass everything after through to
.Xr claude 1
verbatim.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZCLAUDE_MODEL_INTERACTIVE
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root (kernel cwd).
.It Ev ZCLAUDE_MODEL_INTERACTIVE
Interactive model (default: sonnet).
.It Ev ZCLAUDE_MODEL_AUTO
Unattended model for
.Fl -auto
and
.Fl -sync
(default: haiku).
.It Ev ZCLAUDE_MODEL_FEATURE
Feature model (default: opus).
.It Ev ZCLAUDE_FALLBACK_MODEL
Fallback model (default: sonnet).
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa etc/claude/zclaude-bootstrap.md
The pre-loaded platform bootstrap prompt appended to the session.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr capabilities 1 ,
.Xr claude 1 ,
.Xr imperial-date 1 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
